@startgantt
title Software Release 2.0

-- Planning Phase --
[Kickoff Meeting] requires 1 days
[Requirements Gathering] requires 5 days
[Requirements Gathering] starts at [Kickoff Meeting]'s end

-- Development Phase --
[Backend API] requires 10 days
[Backend API] starts at [Requirements Gathering]'s end
[Frontend UI] requires 8 days
[Frontend UI] starts at [Requirements Gathering]'s end
[Integration] requires 3 days
[Integration] starts at [Backend API]'s end

-- Release Phase --
[UAT Testing] requires 4 days
[UAT Testing] starts at [Integration]'s end
[UAT Testing] is colored in Gold/DarkGoldenRod
[Go Live] happens at [UAT Testing]'s end
@endgantt
